('original:science--physical-science-chemistry--elements-compounds-and-mixtures:science--physical-science-chemistry--elements-compounds-and-mixtures--8',1,'{"question":"Why is air usually classified as a mixture?","choices":["Its gases all have the same chemical formula","It contains only one kind of atom","It contains gases in proportions that can vary","Its components are chemically bonded into one molecule"],"answer":2,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'6e49fbda4184c8bc43bdbc0a89b61908','official',NULL,NULL,'Elements Compounds and Mixtures'),
